{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善謂四正勤中未生善、已\n生善也。不善例之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見一處住地也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲愛住地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色愛住地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無色愛住地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明住地。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解釋之文，\n具如向引。"}
