{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不是假借，以譬擬法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戶皆切，骨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眸，目瞳子也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音了，明也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "莫報切，少精也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音倫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作作兩字並祖\n餓切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以十境界對十信位，具如\n補注。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是不空如來藏耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是緣因佛性耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空觀文出無著品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "青黃赤白等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假中二觀文出行品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疎吏切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "放逸者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池喻生死，浴喻恚慢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乘船\n諸業也，遊戲愛果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失寶無解也，入水初教也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "求覓如劣三修，瓦石如證劣三修，各生滅\n度之想故云歡喜，向佛稱歎故云持出。乃知非真已去，喻其常解意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子智切，草名也，若作積也，即委積也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即鳥切，纏繞也，又落蕭切。諸文或作料字，今恐正取落蕭切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昨含切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新云擇滅、非擇\n\n滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方久切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昨到切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今即\n文作胞，胞胎耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常遙切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此周制七\n者，太祖及文王武王之祧與親廟四，太祖后稷；殷則六廟，契及湯與二昭二穆；夏則五廟，無太祖，禹與二\n昭二穆而已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太祖別子始爵者，太傅云\n別子為祖，謂此雖非別子，始爵者亦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂諸侯之中士下士名曰官師者，上士二\n廟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寢，適寢也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方昧切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦作耽，下含切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居陵切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陟慮切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
