{"id": null, "n": "0334001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0334001", "type": "orig", "text": "疆玄作彊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0340001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0340001", "type": "orig", "text": "巳下九十一字惜哉為紙魚損焉後曰應以他本訂之耳"}
{"id": null, "n": "0346001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0346001", "type": "orig", "text": "熾疑幟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0349001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0349001", "type": "orig", "text": "檀疑擅"}
{"id": null, "n": "0360001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0360001", "type": "orig", "text": "此下二十九字紙魚食之惜哉後曰當以他本補焉"}
